{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-wavez-residence","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"wavez-residence","about":"Wavez Residence by Danube Properties is located in Liwan, the impressive township in Dubai that offers extraordinary living amenities at unrivalled prices. There are a total of 414 apartments which includes 338 studios and 76 one-bedroom units. Redefining premium living, these homes are available at never-seen-before affordable prices.Easily accessed from both Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Al Ain Road, this 8,573-square-metre development consists of two ten storey buildings offering amenities that will be a first for any residential property in Liwan. These include a swimming pool, Jacuzzi, jogging track, kid’s play area and a health club too. Importantly, this is also the first project in the entire township that will have a full-fledged integrated retail offering on the premises itself, called Wavez Avenue.Wavez Residence puts open-space living at its very heart. It overlooks a public park and even comprises of a green podium to give residents and visitors a visual respite from the otherwise cramped and constrained living options typically found in major cities.","price":340000,"title":"Wavez Residence","bitrix":{"id":207,"pf_id":"are.3.10617","source":null,"project_id":"Liwan","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Wavez Residence","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Danube Properties","project_location":"Dubai Land"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/waves_residence_banner_8b36351c9a.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/waves_residence_banner_8b36351c9a.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1042758,"lng":55.3710406},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/waves_residence_1_0183f3aae2.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront